{"availability":"available","full":"millsp/ts-toolbelt","name":"ts-toolbelt","description":"👷 TypeScript's largest type utility library","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":7151,"forks":152,"created":"2019-06-08T19:45:04Z","updated":"2025-06-02T02:46:18Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://millsp.github.io/ts-toolbelt/","topics":["dynamic-types","safety","type-checking","type-safety","type-utilities","types","typescript","typescript-library","utility"],"demo":"https://millsp.github.io/ts-toolbelt/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:32.705Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:32.705Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:32.705Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T13:03:32.705Z","stars":7151,"forks":152}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ts-toolbelt is the largest, and most tested type library available right now, featuring +200 utilities. Our type collection packages some of the most advanced mapped types, conditional types, and recursive types on the market.","Spend less time, build stronger. Benefit from a wide range of generic type functions to achieve better type safety.","We work just like lodash, or ramda, but applied to the type system. Our mission is to provide you with simple ways to compute, change, and create types. We abstract all those complex type checks away for you. We provide a simple, reusable, and standard API to help you get more done with TypeScript."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/millsp/ts-toolbelt/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8c4fe607e484a4253407491f25b4d3ba51c448aa7753b4cb3fce784985d7f3ed","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:32.785Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:32.785Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ts-toolbelt is the largest, and most tested type library available right now, featuring +200 utilities. Our type collection packages some of the most advanced mapped types, con